WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.900
- Well it is Motivational Monday

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.910
here on the show,

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:04.644
and I love how you motivate women.

00:00:04.644 --> 00:00:06.710
You really get behind them,

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:07.600
and want 'em to feel
(audience applauding)

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.461
good in their skin.

00:00:09.461 --> 00:00:10.750
You think it's a really,
really important thing.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.170
I love doing that as well.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.310
Like was it always so natural for you?

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.143
- No.

00:00:15.143 --> 00:00:15.976
Absolutely not.

00:00:15.976 --> 00:00:19.040
I was a short, chubby, brown,

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.700
you know, daughter of immigrants.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.560
Very little money.

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.860
Like dreaming of being in
the entertainment industry.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:24.813
And everyone around me was like,

00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:26.350
"What's your back-up plan

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.500
'cause that sounds crazy."

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.370
- People used to ask me all the time

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.600
and it made me so angry.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.433
- Yeah.

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:31.350
Yeah, and so, you know,

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.497
the very first movie I
ever did was a movie called

00:00:33.497 --> 00:00:34.950
"Real Women Have Curves"

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.197
and I was 17.

00:00:36.197 --> 00:00:37.030
(audience applauding)

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:39.440
- Yes. (clapping)

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.120
- You know, I had to play this girl.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.140
I had to take my clothes-

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.260
I had to be in my bra and underwear

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.794
and dance on camera.

00:00:46.794 --> 00:00:49.290
I had to play this character
with so much confidence

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.123
about her body,

00:00:50.123 --> 00:00:52.700
and I could act it, but you know-

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:53.700
People watched that movie

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.640
and gained so much confidence watching it

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.300
and felt so represented,

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.133
but at the same time,

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:00.770
I was just a 17-year-old girl

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:01.830
kind of coming to terms

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.540
with my own body image.
- Yeah.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.170
- And so that was hard

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:07.254
but I feel like ultimately,

00:01:07.254 --> 00:01:10.500
I'm now in an amazing place

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.170
where my relationship

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:14.420
to my body is about celebration

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.020
and not about punishment.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.860
I trained for triathlons
(Kelly gasps)

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.142
starting in 2016,

00:01:19.142 --> 00:01:20.930
and so when I got pregnant,

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:23.010
I was like in "triathlon shape"

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:23.843
or whatever.

00:01:23.843 --> 00:01:25.420
I was very strong and healthy.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.670
And then I had a baby,

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:30.820
and you know, my body can
do both of those things.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.240
I can train for a triathlon

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:35.820
and my body shows up for
me in the ways I ask it to,

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.030
and it created life

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.610
and brought this baby into the world

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.483
and fed this baby, you know.

00:01:41.763 --> 00:01:42.801
And to mourn

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:46.130
one past version of my body

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.460
versus celebrating what it is now

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.840
and what it did, what it did for me,

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:51.720
what it did for my son,

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.301
would be a shame.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:53.301 --> 00:01:56.360
- I'm sure my body will look
like a hundred other things

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.430
in the course of my lifetime
- Girl, me too. (laughs)

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:02.460
- By now, I'm just
committed to loving my body

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.170
and being so grateful to
be in it every single day.

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.240
- That's so-

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.453
That's a great attitude. (claps)

